% director — Nina's director (nina-live, 2026-11-24): the catalog's lifted base (../director_domain.llp, a
% byte-equal copy) and this home's instance. The scenes package is the planner: a scene's three wishes arrive as
% kinds, and each goes to the one package that handles it. The packages run every tick whatever the director says:
% its wake and sleep are its own bookkeeping (Nina serves all five cards).
catalog director 1.
provenance text "the home's director: a scene's wishes to the lights, the air and the media" "2026-11-24".
include "../director_domain.llp".

type domain {lights air media comfort scenes timers agenda}.
type kind {scene_lights scene_air scene_media scene_timers}.

specialist(lights).
specialist(air).
specialist(media).
specialist(comfort).
specialist(timers).
specialist(agenda).
planner(scenes).
handles(lights, scene_lights).
handles(air, scene_air).
handles(media, scene_media).
handles(timers, scene_timers).

#init active(scenes) 1
#init attention(scenes) 1
#init fresh 1
#init inactive(lights) 1
#init inactive(air) 1
#init inactive(media) 1
#init inactive(comfort) 1
#init inactive(timers) 1
#init inactive(agenda) 1
